  deploy --> gates

  gates["Quality Gates"]
  spaps["SPAPS Boundary"]
```

## chart quality Quality Gates
```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> BackendTests
  BackendTests --> BackendCoverage
  BackendCoverage --> CrapScore
  CrapScore --> MMDXPreflight
  MMDXPreflight --> DeployPreflight
  DeployPreflight --> SwiftTests
  SwiftTests --> DriftScan
  DriftScan --> IOSBuild
  IOSBuild --> IOSTests
  IOSTests --> [*]
```

## chart spaps SPAPS Boundary
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant App as iOS App
  participant AuthLink as dogswipe auth link
  participant Maps as Apple Maps
  participant API as DogSwipe API
  participant Worker as menu refresh worker
  participant Menu as Menu URL
  participant SPAPS as Sweet Potato/SPAPS
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  App->>SPAPS: X-API-Key spaps_pub... request magic link with redirect_url
  SPAPS-->>App: Magic-link email token
  AuthLink-->>App: URL open with token_hash/code
  App->>SPAPS: Verify parsed magic-link token
  SPAPS-->>App: Access and refresh JWTs
  App->>API: Keychain-backed Authorization: Bearer access JWT
  API->>SPAPS: Validate user/session
  SPAPS-->>API: AuthenticatedUser.user_id
  App->>API: Discovery request with optional current coordinates
  API->>DB: Read preferences and coordinate-backed hotdog profiles
  API-->>App: Preference-filtered discovery with resolved distance and walking ETA
  App->>Maps: Open directions from coordinates or address_text
  API->>DB: Read swipes, matches, or preferences
  API-->>App: Match or preference response
  App->>API: Submit vendor hotdog listing
  API->>DB: Store pending_review listing, coordinates, address_text, and owner user_id
  API-->>App: Vendor submission response
  App->>API: Refresh owned submission menu
  API->>DB: Load owner-scoped listing and menu_url
  API->>Menu: Fetch bounded HTML/text snapshot
  Menu-->>API: Menu text or fetch error
  API->>DB: Store menu_status, menu_excerpt, and menu_checked_at
  API-->>App: Menu ingestion response
  App->>API: Admin refresh stale vendor menus
  API->>DB: Load stale vendor-owned menu candidates
  API->>Menu: Fetch bounded HTML/text snapshots
  Menu-->>API: Menu text or fetch errors
  API->>DB: Store refreshed menu statuses and timestamps
  API-->>App: Checked/refreshed/failed counts and updated profiles
  Worker->>Worker: Wake on configured interval when enabled
  Worker->>DB: Load stale vendor-owned menu candidates
  Worker->>Menu: Fetch bounded HTML/text snapshots
  Menu-->>Worker: Menu text or fetch errors
  Worker->>DB: Store refreshed menu statuses and timestamps
  App->>API: Admin approve / reject / request edits
  API->>DB: Store review status, note, and timestamps
  API-->>App: Moderated hotdog profile
  App->>API: Vendor revises change-requested listing
  API->>DB: Return listing to pending_review
  API-->>App: Resubmitted vendor profile
```
